  "description": "From [kocca](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2tLpY8H7lJk):\n\nKangho Choi, once a top-fighter, 7 years later he's a part-timer in a convenience store. Now at the age of 23 he makes a resolution to be a nurse?\n\nA nurse who Kangho Choi has a big crush on, Sooyeon Kim, a friend with whom Kangho Choi has an ill-fated relationship. \n\nA punk who wants to be a nurse meets a nursing student who dreams of becoming a musician! Follow the ups and downs in this comedy drama of two young men who want to be the best warrior in white!\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://comics.nate.com/webtoon/list.php?btno=52666)",
